				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6edeab49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6edeab49" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-13de2709 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="13de2709" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The one beauty niche <span class="hl">sold entirely as a subscription in disguise</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-14521aa2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="14521aa2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55cb82a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="55cb82a3" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2b4ddff3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2b4ddff3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Laser hair removal is almost unique in beauty: clients pay upfront for 4-8 sessions before results are even fully visible. That makes the real marketing challenge completion, not acquisition — a clinic that fills its first-session calendar but loses half its clients by session four is bleeding revenue silently, package by package.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5195c4a2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5195c4a2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Skin-tone-matched technology is a genuine trust signal, not a technicality</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-563e568b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="563e568b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Nd:YAG lasers are the safer, more effective choice for darker skin tones, while Alexandrite suits fair-to-medium tones — in a market as ethnically diverse as the UAE, clinics that explain their technology choice openly build meaningfully more trust than those pushing one device for every client.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2d7468bc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2d7468bc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Package completion reminders are the highest-leverage retention lever available</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4fc542bc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4fc542bc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>With sessions spaced 4-8 weeks apart, it&#8217;s easy for a client to quietly drop off after session three or four — timed reminder campaigns tied to each client&#8217;s specific package and area are one of the most measurable revenue-recovery tactics in this entire industry.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-59435655 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="59435655" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5c02da24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5c02da24" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Laser hair removal clinics, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Pre-paid model</b><span>— clients commit to 4-8 sessions upfront</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">15-40%</b><span>typical package savings vs. single-session pricing</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">3 laser types</b><span>— matched by skin tone for safety &amp; results</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Completion risk</b><span>— full-body packages see the most drop-off</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
