														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Why focus on "package completion" instead of just new bookings?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1351" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1351"><p>Because most laser clinics sell 4-8 session packages upfront — a client who drops off at session three represents lost revenue that&#8217;s often invisible until you track completion rates directly, which is exactly what our reminder campaigns are built to recover.</p></div>
				</div>
