														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Can you help us market to clients with darker skin tones specifically?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1352" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1352"><p>Yes — explaining your Nd:YAG or multi-wavelength technology openly, and why it&#8217;s the safer choice for darker skin, is one of the most underused trust-building content angles in this industry, and one we build in directly.</p></div>
				</div>
