														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Do you have experience marketing to male clients for this service?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1353" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1353"><p>Yes — men&#8217;s grooming (back, beard-line, chest) needs genuinely different creative and messaging from female-facing campaigns, and it&#8217;s a growing, still-underserved segment we treat as its own audience.</p></div>
