					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1354" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1354"><p>Yes — it&#8217;s built to answer the two most common first questions (how many sessions, is it safe for my skin tone) using your clinic&#8217;s real package information, then book the consultation.</p></div>
