					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1355" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="5" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1355"><p>It varies by package — facial-hair packages often complete within 3-4 months, while full-body packages with 8 sessions spaced 4-8 weeks apart can span 8-12 months, which is exactly why completion marketing matters so much.</p></div>
